@inheritdoc IIndexFactory
 @dev Only affects future clones. Existing portfolios keep their original
      implementation via ERC-1167's immutable-bytecode model. Rejects
      addresses with no deployed code to prevent silently bricking
      future creates with a typo'd / EOA address.

@inheritdoc IIndexFactory
 @dev Rejects `amount == 0` to prevent accidental floor removal. Setting
      a tiny non-zero floor (e.g., 1 wei) is the explicit way to
      effectively disable per-token gating.
